d-overlay-ui="true" contenteditable="false"><div class="css-17xejub"></div><div class="css-17xejub"></div></div><div dir="ltr" class="card-content is-dark" data-node-view-content="" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><div data-node-view-content-inner="card"><div data-layout-item-id="body" class="react-renderer node-cardLayoutItem node-cardLayoutItem"><div dir="ltr" as="div" data-node-view-wrapper="" style="white-space: normal;"><div data-content-reference="true" class="card-layout-cell-bg css-1jw19ud" data-selection-ring="true" data-selection-background="true"><div data-node-view-content="" style="white-space: pre-wrap; width: 100%;"><div data-node-view-content-inner="cardLayoutItem"><div class="gml-label-group first-block first-block-in-card gml-commentable-block" dir="auto"><div class="gml-label-group__items"><span class="gml-label-wrapper"><span class="gml-label" data-variant="solid"><span class="gml-label__content">System Architecture</span></span></span></div><div class="gml-label-group__controls"></div></div><div class="gml-heading-wrapper gml-commentable-block" style="align-items: var(--flex-align);"><h2 class="gml-heading gml-heading-text heading themed-heading" dir="auto" data-placeholder="Heading 2" style="align-self: var(--descendant-align-self, self-start);">How the Constellation Operates</h2></div><div class="react-renderer node-gridLayout block block-gridLayout"><div class="annotatable-node-view-wrapper is-mobile" data-node-view-wrapper="" style="white-space: normal; position: relative;"><div class="grid-col-controls css-q5jvu9" data-selection-ring="true"><div class="layout-content" data-node-view-content="" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><div data-node-view-content-inner="gridLayout"><div class="react-renderer node-gridCell node-gridCell"><div class="grid-cell" data-disable-shrink-item="false" data-selection-ring="true" data-node-view-wrapper="" style="white-space: normal; position: relative;"><div data-node-view-content="" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><div data-node-view-content-inner="gridCell"><div class="gml-heading-wrapper first-block gml-commentable-block" style="align-items: var(--flex-align);"><h3 class="gml-heading gml-heading-text heading themed-heading" dir="auto" data-placeholder="Heading 3" style="align-self: var(--descendant-align-self, self-start);">Asynchronous Communication</h3></div><div class="gml-paragraph-wrapper gml-commentable-block"><p class="gml-paragraph" dir="auto">All 25 agents exchange tasks and results through a distributed message queue architecture (AWS SQS, RabbitMQ, or Apache Kafka), ensuring complete decoupling and fault tolerance. Each agent operates independently while contributing to the larger ecosystem.</p></div><div class="gml-heading-wrapper gml-commentable-block" style="align-items: var(--flex-align);"><h3 class="gml-heading gml-heading-text heading themed-heading" dir="auto" data-placeholder="Heading 3" style="align-self: var(--descendant-align-self, self-start);">Data-Driven Intelligence</h3></div><div class="gml-paragraph-wrapper gml-commentable-block"><p class="gml-paragraph" dir="auto">Every agent leverages domain-specific datasetsâ€”code repositories for Earth, vulnerability databases for Mars, performance benchmarks for Sunâ€”enabling specialized expertise at scale.</p></div><div class="gml-heading-wrapper gml-commentable-block" style="align-items: var(--flex-align);"><h3 class="gml-heading gml-heading-text heading themed-heading" dir="auto" data-placeholder="Heading 3" style="align-self: var(--descendant-align-self, self-start);">API-First Design</h3></div><div class="gml-paragraph-wrapper gml-commentable-block"><p class="gml-paragraph" dir="auto">All agents expose REST or GraphQL endpoints for external interaction, making the constellation fully extensible and integration-ready with existing development workflows.</p></div><div class="gml-heading-wrapper gml-commentable-block" style="align-items: var(--flex-align);"><h3 class="gml-heading gml-heading-text heading themed-heading" dir="auto" data-placeholder="Heading 3" style="align-self: var(--descendant-align-self, self-start);">Continuous Learning</h3></div><div class="gml-paragraph-wrapper gml-commentable-block"><p class="gml-paragraph" dir="auto">Agents retrain on new data and incorporate user feedback through automated ML pipelines orchestrated by Hydra, ensuring continuous improvement of accuracy and capabilities.</p></div><div class="gml-heading-wrapper gml-commentable-block" style="align-items: var(--flex-align);"><h3 class="gml-heading gml-heading-text heading themed-heading" dir="auto" data-placeholder="Heading 3" style="align-self: var(--descendant-align-self, self-start);">Comprehensive Observability</h3></div><div class="gml-paragraph-wrapper last-block gml-commentable-block"><p class="gml-paragraph" dir="auto">Draco and BoÃ¶tes provide end-to-end monitoring, security oversight, and performance analytics across the entire agent constellation, ensuring reliability and security at every layer.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="react-renderer node-gridCell node-gridCell"><div class="grid-cell" data-disable-shrink-item="false" data-selection-ring="true" data-node-view-wrapper="" style="white-space: normal; position: relative;"><div data-node-view-content="" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><div data-node-view-content-inner="gridCell"><div class="react-renderer node-smartLayout block block-smartLayout first-block"><div class="" dir="ltr" data-node-view-wrapper="" style="white-space: normal; position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 100%;"><div data-selection-ring="padded" dir="ltr" class="css-7iitlo"><div data-node-view-content-outer="smartLayout" data-node-view-content="" style="white-space: pre-wrap;"><div data-node-view-content-inner="smartLayout"><div class="react-renderer node-smartLayoutCell node-smartLayoutCell"><div data-node-view-wrapper="" style="white-space: normal;"><div data-spotlight-parent="true" class="css-1doss8g" style="--de